1. Using the actual domain from the handle instead of hardcoded "diaspora.example.com"
2. URL-encoding the handle using urllib.parse.quote()
3. Adding proper error handling for HTTP requests
4. Adding timeout to prevent hanging
5. Adding XML parsing error handling
6. Adding input validation for the handle format
7. Using raise_for_status() to catch bad HTTP responses

The code now properly handles network errors, invalid responses, and malformed input while maintaining the original functionality.

